{"title":"Career Roadmap · NLP Data Annotator","role":"NLP Data Annotator","summary":"An NLP Data Annotator prepares and labels language data so that artificial-intelligence and natural-language-processing systems can learn from it. The work can include text classification, sentiment annotation, intent labelling, named-entity recognition, speech transcription, linguistic tagging, conversational-data annotation, evaluation of AI outputs, and quality control.","facts":{"Starts":"Year 1 UG · 2026","Current degree":"BA (Bachelor of Arts – General / Honours)","Course":"Linguistics"},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[{"period":"2026–2030","question":"What can I enter now?","output":"Build linguistics + annotation + Python + NLP fundamentals"},{"period":"2030–2035","question":"How should I specialise?","output":"Move into linguistic data, AI evaluation, multilingual NLP or annotation quality"},{"period":"2035–2040","question":"How should I evolve?","output":"Progress toward Linguistic Data Specialist, NLP Evaluator, Computational Linguistics or NLP Operations"},{"period":"2040–2046","question":"How can I remain relevant?","output":"Combine linguistics with multilingual AI, LLM evaluation, speech technology and language-data strategy"}],"sections":[{"heading":"Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A Linguistics degree is particularly useful because annotation requires understanding grammar, syntax, semantics, pragmatics, morphology, discourse, multilingual variation and language context, not simply reading and typing text."}]},{"heading":"Career-route check","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"BA Linguistics is a strong foundation for language-focused NLP annotation. However, students should add practical skills in Python, spreadsheets, data annotation platforms, NLP concepts, JSON/CSV, basic statistics and AI evaluation."},{"type":"p","text":"A realistic route is:"},{"type":"flow","items":["BA Linguistics","Linguistic/NLP Internship","NLP Data Annotator","Senior Annotator / Annotation QA","Linguistic Data Specialist / NLP Evaluation Specialist","Computational Linguist / NLP Specialist"]},{"type":"p","text":"For higher-level NLP engineering roles, a student will generally need substantially stronger programming, mathematics, machine learning and NLP skills."}]},{"heading":"Career Horizons","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"These are practical career-planning horizons, not guaranteed promotion timelines."}]},{"heading":"What to Build Each Year","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["When","Build this","Learn from","Proof of progress","Gap it moves"],"rows":[[{"text":"Year 1 Sem 1"},{"text":"Linguistics fundamentals"},{"text":"BA Linguistics curriculum"},{"text":"Linguistic analysis assignments"},{"text":"Language foundation"}],[{"text":"Year 1 Sem 2"},{"text":"Syntax + morphology + semantics"},{"text":"Linguistics coursework"},{"text":"Annotated linguistic datasets"},{"text":"Annotation foundation"}],[{"text":"Year 2 Sem 1"},{"text":"Python + data handling"},{"text":"Python Documentation","url":"https://docs.python.org/3/"},{"text":"3 data-processing scripts"},{"text":"Technical literacy"}],[{"text":"Year 2 Sem 2"},{"text":"NLP fundamentals"},{"text":"NLP courses + tutorials"},{"text":"Text-classification project"},{"text":"NLP knowledge"}],[{"text":"Year 3 Sem 1"},{"text":"Annotation tools + guidelines"},{"text":"Annotation projects"},{"text":"Labelled dataset + guideline document"},{"text":"Annotation skill"}],[{"text":"Year 3 Sem 2"},{"text":"AI evaluation"},{"text":"LLM/NLP projects"},{"text":"Evaluation dataset + error analysis"},{"text":"AI evaluation"}],[{"text":"Year 4 Sem 1"},{"text":"Multilingual NLP"},{"text":"Indian-language datasets/projects"},{"text":"Multilingual annotation project"},{"text":"Specialisation"}],[{"text":"Year 4 Sem 2"},{"text":"Professional portfolio"},{"text":"Internship + NLP project"},{"text":"Portfolio + CV + references"},{"text":"Employability"}]]},{"type":"h","text":"Core Linguistics Stack"},{"type":"h","text":"1. Phonetics"},{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Speech sounds"},{"text":"Articulatory phonetics"},{"text":"Acoustic phonetics"},{"text":"IPA"},{"text":"Vowels"},{"text":"Consonants"},{"text":"Stress"},{"text":"Intonation"},{"text":"Prosody"}]},{"type":"p","text":"This is particularly valuable if the student wants to move into speech recognition, speech annotation or voice-AI datasets."}]},{"heading":"Phonology","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Study:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Phonemes"},{"text":"Allophones"},{"text":"Syllable structure"},{"text":"Phonological rules"},{"text":"Stress"},{"text":"Tone"},{"text":"Prosody"},{"text":"Sound patterns"}]}]},{"heading":"Morphology","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Morphemes"},{"text":"Roots"},{"text":"Affixes"},{"text":"Inflection"},{"text":"Derivation"},{"text":"Compounding"},{"text":"Reduplication"},{"text":"Morphological segmentation"}]},{"type":"p","text":"This is especially important for languages with rich morphology."}]},{"heading":"Syntax","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Constituents"},{"text":"Phrase structure"},{"text":"Dependency relationships"},{"text":"Word order"},{"text":"Grammatical relations"},{"text":"Agreement"},{"text":"Coordination"},{"text":"Subordination"},{"text":"Ambiguity"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Example:"},{"type":"p","text":"“The student saw the teacher with the telescope.”"},{"type":"p","text":"The annotation may need to capture whether the telescope belongs to the student's observation or is associated with the teacher."},{"type":"p","text":"Understanding such ambiguity is valuable in high-quality language annotation."}]},{"heading":"Semantics","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Study:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Word meaning"},{"text":"Polysemy"},{"text":"Homonymy"},{"text":"Synonymy"},{"text":"Semantic roles"},{"text":"Word sense"},{"text":"Entailment"},{"text":"Contradiction"},{"text":"Semantic similarity"}]}]},{"heading":"Pragmatics & Discourse","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Context"},{"text":"Speaker intention"},{"text":"Implicature"},{"text":"Conversation structure"},{"text":"Reference"},{"text":"Coreference"},{"text":"Discourse relations"},{"text":"Context-dependent meaning"}]},{"type":"p","text":"This becomes particularly important for chatbot and LLM evaluation."},{"type":"h","text":"NLP Technical Stack"},{"type":"h","text":"Python"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Variables"},{"text":"Functions"},{"text":"Lists/dictionaries"},{"text":"File handling"},{"text":"Regular expressions"},{"text":"JSON"},{"text":"CSV"},{"text":"APIs"},{"text":"Basic data processing"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Useful libraries:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"pandas"},{"text":"NumPy"},{"text":"spaCy"},{"text":"NLTK"},{"text":"scikit-learn"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Use Python Documentation and pandas as foundational references.","url":"https://docs.python.org/3/"},{"type":"h","text":"NLP Concepts"},{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Tokenisation"},{"text":"Sentence segmentation"},{"text":"Part-of-speech tagging"},{"text":"Lemmatization"},{"text":"Stemming"},{"text":"Named-entity recognition"},{"text":"Sentiment analysis"},{"text":"Intent classification"},{"text":"Text classification"},{"text":"Topic classification"},{"text":"Language identification"},{"text":"Coreference"},{"text":"Semantic similarity"},{"text":"Text summarisation"},{"text":"Machine translation"},{"text":"Speech recognition"},{"text":"Question answering"}]},{"type":"p","text":"What Does an NLP Data Annotator Actually Label?"},{"type":"h","text":"Text classification"},{"type":"p","text":"Example:"},{"type":"p","text":"“I cannot log into my account.”"},{"type":"p","text":"Label:"},{"type":"h","text":"Intent = Login Problem"},{"type":"h","text":"Sentiment"},{"type":"p","text":"“The service was extremely helpful.”"},{"type":"p","text":"Label:"},{"type":"h","text":"Sentiment = Positive"},{"type":"h","text":"Named Entity Recognition"},{"type":"p","text":"“Mahendra moved to Hyderabad.”"},{"type":"p","text":"Labels:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Mahendra → PERSON"},{"text":"Hyderabad → LOCATION"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Part-of-speech"},{"type":"p","text":"“The researcher analysed the dataset.”"},{"type":"p","text":"Possible labels:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"The → Determiner"},{"text":"researcher → Noun"},{"text":"analysed → Verb"},{"text":"the → Determiner"},{"text":"dataset → Noun"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Entity linking"},{"type":"p","text":"Determine which real-world entity a mention refers to."},{"type":"h","text":"Speech transcription"},{"type":"p","text":"Convert recorded speech into accurately formatted text."},{"type":"h","text":"LLM response evaluation"},{"type":"p","text":"Evaluate whether an AI response is:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Correct"},{"text":"Relevant"},{"text":"Complete"},{"text":"Safe"},{"text":"Grounded"},{"text":"Grammatically appropriate"},{"text":"Culturally appropriate"},{"text":"Instruction-following"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Annotation Quality Skills"},{"type":"p","text":"This is one of the most important areas for the career."},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Annotation guidelines"},{"text":"Label definitions"},{"text":"Edge cases"},{"text":"Ambiguous examples"},{"text":"Inter-annotator agreement"},{"text":"Cohen's kappa"},{"text":"Quality sampling"},{"text":"Error analysis"},{"text":"Adjudication"},{"text":"Annotation consistency"},{"text":"Dataset versioning"},{"text":"Data privacy"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Annotation workflow"},{"type":"flow","items":["Guidelines","Sample data","Label","Quality check","Disagreement analysis","Adjudication","Dataset release"]},{"type":"p","text":"A good annotator should not simply label quickly."},{"type":"p","text":"The objective is consistent, defensible and reproducible annotation."},{"type":"h","text":"Data Skills"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"h","text":"Excel/Sheets"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Filtering"},{"text":"Sorting"},{"text":"Pivot tables"},{"text":"Data validation"},{"text":"Conditional logic"},{"text":"Quality checks"}]},{"type":"h","text":"SQL"},{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"SELECT"},{"text":"WHERE"},{"text":"GROUP BY"},{"text":"JOIN"},{"text":"COUNT"},{"text":"CASE"}]},{"type":"h","text":"JSON/CSV"},{"type":"p","text":"Understand how annotation datasets are stored."},{"type":"p","text":"Example:"},{"type":"p","text":"{"},{"type":"p","text":"\"text\": \"The delivery was late\","},{"type":"p","text":"\"intent\": \"delivery_issue\","},{"type":"p","text":"\"sentiment\": \"negative\""},{"type":"p","text":"}"},{"type":"h","text":"Basic statistics"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Mean"},{"text":"Median"},{"text":"Distribution"},{"text":"Sampling"},{"text":"Accuracy"},{"text":"Precision"},{"text":"Recall"},{"text":"F1 score"},{"text":"Agreement metrics"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Projects to Build Before Graduation"},{"type":"h","text":"Project 1 — Sentiment Dataset"},{"type":"p","text":"Create a small, ethically sourced dataset of text and label:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Positive"},{"text":"Negative"},{"text":"Neutral"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Then measure annotation consistency."},{"type":"h","text":"Project 2 — Intent Dataset"},{"type":"p","text":"Build a dataset for a fictional customer-support chatbot."},{"type":"p","text":"Example labels:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Payment issue"},{"text":"Refund request"},{"text":"Account problem"},{"text":"Delivery issue"},{"text":"Product information"},{"text":"Cancellation"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Project 3 — NER Dataset"},{"type":"p","text":"Annotate:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"PERSON"},{"text":"ORGANISATION"},{"text":"LOCATION"},{"text":"DATE"},{"text":"PRODUCT"},{"text":"EVENT"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Project 4 — Linguistic Annotation"},{"type":"p","text":"Take a small public text corpus and annotate:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"POS"},{"text":"Morphology"},{"text":"Syntax"},{"text":"Semantic roles"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Project 5 — Multilingual Dataset"},{"type":"p","text":"Build a small English + one Indian language dataset."},{"type":"p","text":"Possible languages:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Hindi"},{"text":"Telugu"},{"text":"Tamil"},{"text":"Kannada"},{"text":"Malayalam"},{"text":"Bengali"},{"text":"Marathi"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Document language-specific challenges such as:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Code-switching"},{"text":"Transliteration"},{"text":"Morphology"},{"text":"Word segmentation"},{"text":"Spelling variation"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Project 6 — LLM Evaluation Dataset"},{"type":"p","text":"Create 100–200 prompts and evaluate AI responses for:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Correctness"},{"text":"Relevance"},{"text":"Instruction following"},{"text":"Hallucination"},{"text":"Safety"},{"text":"Language quality"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Create an error taxonomy."},{"type":"h","text":"Specialisation Options"},{"type":"table","header":["Lane","Core stack","Senior role it leads to"],"rows":[[{"text":"Text Annotation"},{"text":"Linguistics + NLP + annotation"},{"text":"Linguistic Data Specialist"}],[{"text":"LLM Evaluation"},{"text":"Linguistics + prompting + evaluation"},{"text":"AI/NLP Evaluation Specialist"}],[{"text":"Multilingual NLP"},{"text":"Linguistics + Indian languages + NLP"},{"text":"Multilingual NLP Specialist"}],[{"text":"Speech Data"},{"text":"Phonetics + transcription + speech"},{"text":"Speech Data Specialist"}],[{"text":"Conversational AI"},{"text":"Pragmatics + intent + dialogue"},{"text":"Conversational AI Evaluator"}],[{"text":"Search/Relevance"},{"text":"Semantics + information retrieval"},{"text":"Search Quality Specialist"}],[{"text":"AI Safety Evaluation"},{"text":"Language + policy + evaluation"},{"text":"AI Safety Data Specialist"}],[{"text":"Machine Translation"},{"text":"Linguistics + bilingual knowledge"},{"text":"MT Evaluation Specialist"}],[{"text":"Computational Linguistics"},{"text":"Linguistics + Python + NLP"},{"text":"Computational Linguist"}],[{"text":"NLP Engineering"},{"text":"Python + ML + NLP + mathematics"},{"text":"NLP Engineer"}]]},{"type":"h","text":"Four-Year Honours Variant"},{"type":"p","text":"For a 4-year BA Honours in Linguistics, use the additional year to bridge from traditional linguistics toward computational linguistics."},{"type":"p","text":"Recommended profile:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Linguistics","Python","Statistics","NLP","Annotation","LLM Evaluation","Multilingual Language Technology"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"The final-year project could involve:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Indian-language NLP"},{"text":"Speech recognition"},{"text":"Machine translation"},{"text":"Code-switching"},{"text":"Sentiment analysis"},{"text":"LLM evaluation"},{"text":"Computational morphology"},{"text":"NLP bias"},{"text":"Language-resource creation"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Evolve and Stay Relevant — 2035–2046"},{"type":"p","text":"Simple annotation work is increasingly being assisted or automated by AI. Therefore, the long-term goal should not be to remain only a manual labeler."},{"type":"p","text":"The professional should move toward:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Annotation","Quality Control","Linguistic Data Specialist","AI Evaluation","Computational Linguistics / Language Technology"]},{"type":"p","text":"Future opportunities include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"LLM evaluation"},{"text":"AI safety evaluation"},{"text":"Multilingual AI"},{"text":"Speech AI"},{"text":"Machine translation"},{"text":"AI red teaming from a language perspective"},{"text":"Language-resource development"},{"text":"Search relevance"},{"text":"Conversational AI"},{"text":"Human-AI interaction"},{"text":"Responsible AI"},{"text":"Cultural/language evaluation"}]},{"type":"p","text":"The most valuable combination will be:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Linguistics","Data","NLP","AI Evaluation","Multilingual Expertise"],"sep":"+"}]},{"heading":"Internships","kind":"internships","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Government / Research / Institutional"},{"type":"table","header":["Organisation / environment","Useful exposure"],"rows":[[{"text":"Central Institute of Indian Languages (CIIL)"},{"text":"Indian-language research and language technology"}],[{"text":"Language-resource research projects"},{"text":"Corpus and annotation work"}],[{"text":"IIT/IISc/NIT research groups"},{"text":"NLP and computational linguistics"}],[{"text":"University linguistics departments"},{"text":"Linguistic research and corpus development"}],[{"text":"Digital humanities projects"},{"text":"Text and language annotation"}],[{"text":"Government language-technology initiatives"},{"text":"Indian-language NLP"}],[{"text":"AI/ML research labs"},{"text":"NLP datasets and evaluation"}],[{"text":"PM Internship Scheme"},{"text":"General industry exposure where eligible"}]]},{"type":"p","text":"Research opportunities should be checked directly with the relevant institution because project availability changes."},{"type":"p","text":"For structured learning, use NPTEL.","url":"https://nptel.ac.in/"},{"type":"h","text":"Private / Industry"},{"type":"p","text":"Target:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"AI companies"},{"text":"NLP companies"},{"text":"Conversational-AI companies"},{"text":"Search companies"},{"text":"Voice-AI companies"},{"text":"Translation/localisation companies"},{"text":"Data-labeling companies"},{"text":"AI evaluation companies"},{"text":"EdTech companies"},{"text":"Speech-tech companies"},{"text":"Customer-support AI companies"},{"text":"Research labs"},{"text":"Content-intelligence companies"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Search titles"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"NLP Data Annotator Intern"},{"text":"Linguistic Data Intern"},{"text":"AI Data Annotator"},{"text":"Language Data Intern"},{"text":"NLP Annotation Intern"},{"text":"AI Evaluation Intern"},{"text":"LLM Evaluation Intern"},{"text":"Linguistic QA Intern"},{"text":"Speech Data Annotator"},{"text":"Language Quality Analyst Intern"},{"text":"Computational Linguistics Intern"},{"text":"AI Data Quality Intern"}]}]},{"heading":"Certifications in Demand","kind":"certifications","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Certification / learning area","Why it matters"],"rows":[[{"text":"NLP fundamentals"},{"text":"Core technical knowledge"}],[{"text":"Computational Linguistics"},{"text":"Bridges linguistics and AI"}],[{"text":"Python"},{"text":"Automation and data handling"}],[{"text":"Machine Learning fundamentals"},{"text":"Understanding model workflows"}],[{"text":"NLP with Python"},{"text":"Practical implementation"}],[{"text":"Corpus Linguistics"},{"text":"Language-data expertise"}],[{"text":"Data Annotation"},{"text":"Direct role relevance"}],[{"text":"LLM Evaluation"},{"text":"Growing AI-evaluation pathway"}],[{"text":"Statistics"},{"text":"Quality and evaluation"}],[{"text":"SQL"},{"text":"Dataset operations"}],[{"text":"Data Visualisation"},{"text":"Reporting"}],[{"text":"AI Ethics & Responsible AI"},{"text":"Evaluation and safety"}]]},{"type":"p","text":"Useful foundations can be developed through NPTEL, Python Documentation and scikit-learn.","url":"https://nptel.ac.in/"},{"type":"note","label":"Important","text":"For this role, demonstrated annotation quality, linguistic expertise and dataset experience can be more valuable than accumulating certificates."},{"type":"note","label":"Certification costs should be","text":"check the official site before entering them into a live database."}]},{"heading":"Careers You Can Be Hired As","kind":"careers","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Realistic entry-level titles"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"NLP Data Annotator"},{"text":"AI Data Annotator"},{"text":"Linguistic Data Annotator"},{"text":"Language Data Associate"},{"text":"NLP Annotation Associate"},{"text":"AI Evaluation Associate"},{"text":"Linguistic QA Associate"},{"text":"Language Quality Analyst"},{"text":"Speech Data Annotator"},{"text":"Data Quality Associate"},{"text":"NLP Research Assistant"},{"text":"Linguistic Research Assistant"},{"text":"AI Data Specialist — Junior"},{"text":"Computational Linguistics Intern"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Role-to-skill map"},{"type":"table","header":["Role","Stack the posting asks for","Where the student proves it"],"rows":[[{"text":"NLP Data Annotator"},{"text":"Linguistics + annotation"},{"text":"Labelled dataset"}],[{"text":"AI Data Annotator"},{"text":"Annotation + data quality"},{"text":"Annotation portfolio"}],[{"text":"Linguistic Data Associate"},{"text":"Linguistics + research"},{"text":"Corpus project"}],[{"text":"LLM Evaluation Associate"},{"text":"Linguistics + evaluation"},{"text":"LLM evaluation dataset"}],[{"text":"Language Quality Analyst"},{"text":"Language + QA"},{"text":"Error-analysis portfolio"}],[{"text":"Speech Data Annotator"},{"text":"Phonetics + transcription"},{"text":"Speech annotation project"}],[{"text":"NLP Research Assistant"},{"text":"Linguistics + Python + research"},{"text":"Research project"}],[{"text":"AI Data Specialist"},{"text":"Annotation + Python + data"},{"text":"Data-processing project"}],[{"text":"Computational Linguistics Intern"},{"text":"Linguistics + NLP + coding"},{"text":"NLP project"}]]},{"type":"h","text":"Career reality"},{"type":"p","text":"NLP Data Annotator is an accessible entry point for a Linguistics graduate who adds technical skills."},{"type":"p","text":"However, manual annotation can become increasingly automated. The student should therefore deliberately build toward annotation QA, linguistic evaluation, multilingual NLP, LLM evaluation or computational linguistics."}]},{"heading":"Postgraduate Study in India","kind":"pg_india","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["PG pathway","Useful for"],"rows":[[{"text":"MA Linguistics"},{"text":"Advanced linguistic research"}],[{"text":"MA Computational Linguistics"},{"text":"NLP/language technology"}],[{"text":"MSc Computational Linguistics"},{"text":"Technical NLP pathway"}],[{"text":"MSc Natural Language Processing"},{"text":"Advanced NLP"}],[{"text":"MSc Data Science"},{"text":"Data/AI transition"}],[{"text":"MSc Artificial Intelligence"},{"text":"Broader AI pathway"}],[{"text":"MSc Computer Science"},{"text":"Technical transition where eligible"}],[{"text":"MA Language Technology"},{"text":"Language + technology"}],[{"text":"MA Digital Humanities"},{"text":"Language + technology + humanities"}],[{"text":"MA/PG in Speech & Language Technology"},{"text":"Speech AI"}],[{"text":"Master's in AI/ML"},{"text":"Advanced AI"}],[{"text":"PhD Computational Linguistics/NLP"},{"text":"Research and academia"}]]},{"type":"h","text":"Particularly useful combinations"},{"type":"h","text":"BA Linguistics + MA Computational Linguistics"},{"type":"p","text":"→ Computational Linguist"},{"type":"h","text":"BA Linguistics + MSc NLP"},{"type":"p","text":"→ NLP Specialist"},{"type":"h","text":"BA Linguistics + Data Science"},{"type":"p","text":"→ Language Data Scientist"},{"type":"h","text":"BA Linguistics + AI/ML"},{"type":"p","text":"→ NLP/AI Specialist"},{"type":"h","text":"BA Linguistics + Speech Technology"},{"type":"p","text":"→ Speech AI Specialist"}]},{"heading":"Study Abroad — Country by Country","kind":"abroad","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Country","Example universities/programme areas to research","Scholarship route","Gate to check"],"rows":[[{"text":"USA"},{"text":"Computational linguistics, NLP, speech and language technology programmes"},{"text":"University funding + Fulbright"},{"text":"Mathematics/programming prerequisites"}],[{"text":"UK"},